WEBVTT

00:12.353 --> 00:15.940
My domain is simply full of grass...

00:24.823 --> 00:30.079
After a month of reluctantly being
put on a carriage from the Royal Capital...

00:34.411 --> 00:36.538
We're here.

00:37.878 --> 00:38.879
Get down.

00:42.925 --> 00:46.720
Indeed, a land fitting for an orphan
who has risen to prominence like you.

00:47.495 --> 00:49.764
Here is the map
showing the boundaries of the land

00:49.765 --> 00:52.851
and the title as bestowed by the king.

00:54.395 --> 00:56.230
The name of this grassland is...

00:56.735 --> 00:58.524
Netzros.

00:59.483 --> 01:03.654
From today, you are Dias Netzros.

01:11.517 --> 01:12.580
This is...

01:13.489 --> 01:14.748
my domain.

01:16.125 --> 01:18.877
Thanks to my military exploits
during the war...

01:19.003 --> 01:21.046
I was granted a territory
by the king.

01:22.467 --> 01:24.258
I'm still trying to understand,

01:24.592 --> 01:27.588
but I heard that the duty of
the lord is to live here...

01:27.720 --> 01:33.475
protect his people, and collect taxes from them
for submission to the Royal Capital.

01:39.793 --> 01:41.859
Fortunately,
there's a clean water source.

01:42.810 --> 01:45.737
I had to drink muddy water
all the time during the war.

01:46.947 --> 01:49.825
I've been walking for a while
but haven't met anyone.

01:50.367 --> 01:52.394
There's not even a single tree.

01:55.363 --> 01:56.640
I see.

01:56.737 --> 01:59.459
My land is just full of grass.

02:05.633 --> 02:06.508
This is bad.

02:09.859 --> 02:11.930
I'll just try to do what I can.

02:12.276 --> 02:14.475
If I wait for two more days
and nothing changes...

02:14.692 --> 02:18.045
I'll leave this grassland
before I die on the side of the road here.

02:19.078 --> 02:24.192
I'll head to the nearest village and find a job
that will help others to survive.

02:24.592 --> 02:27.612
That way, I can
fulfill my parents' dying wishes.

02:31.128 --> 02:31.675
Hey.

02:32.660 --> 02:34.078
Who are you?

02:34.635 --> 02:35.287
Wake up!

02:36.264 --> 02:37.498
Wake up!

02:41.303 --> 02:44.041
Who are you, and what are you doing here?

02:45.691 --> 02:47.799
My name is Dias.

02:47.800 --> 02:50.719
As you can see,
I was just sleeping here.

02:51.011 --> 02:53.055
Why are you resting in a place like this?

02:53.514 --> 02:55.891
Because I have nowhere else to sleep.

02:57.059 --> 02:58.977
Are you stupid?

02:59.269 --> 03:00.813
I can't deny that.

03:01.343 --> 03:03.941
I'm this old
but I've never received an education.

03:04.611 --> 03:05.775
What about you?

03:05.776 --> 03:08.486
Why did you step into this grassland?

03:08.487 --> 03:09.988
What is your purpose?

03:10.322 --> 03:12.366
I was told to live here.

03:12.866 --> 03:14.702
My immediate goal is...

03:16.405 --> 03:18.288
I don't want to die,
so I must survive first.

03:19.707 --> 03:21.721
Hey, wait, hold on a second.

03:22.120 --> 03:23.414
Answer seriously.

03:23.669 --> 03:25.963
I am answering seriously.

03:28.167 --> 03:29.217
Oh, right.

03:30.254 --> 03:34.884
I want to follow my parents' dying wishes,
to become a useful person...

03:35.521 --> 03:37.057
and protect the weak.

03:37.553 --> 03:39.434
That is my goal.

03:42.711 --> 03:44.738
Why aren't you lying?

03:45.122 --> 03:48.312
There's no reason to lie.

03:50.269 --> 03:53.449
Are you a foe or are you a friend!?

03:53.812 --> 03:57.327
It's hard to answer that
when we've just met.

03:57.619 --> 03:59.913
Is it not okay to be neither?

04:00.080 --> 04:02.207
No, give me a clear answer!

04:02.624 --> 04:05.294
Why is she so angry?

04:06.420 --> 04:09.464
Wait, this is my territory.

04:09.465 --> 04:11.633
So she is one of my people.

04:12.176 --> 04:15.052
She's probably upset
because I am the lord...

04:15.053 --> 04:17.431
yet I didn't affirm
that I would take her side.

04:20.762 --> 04:22.656
I am your ally.

04:23.144 --> 04:24.984
No matter who the enemy is...

04:25.230 --> 04:27.274
I will protect you!

04:31.320 --> 04:33.930
Why is it this strong?

04:37.710 --> 04:39.468
What was that light just now?

04:40.937 --> 04:42.622
Hey! What's wrong?

04:42.623 --> 04:43.999
Be quiet and follow me!

04:52.782 --> 04:53.534
A village?

04:54.357 --> 04:58.233
I walked all over the place yesterday,
why didn't I see this one until now?

04:58.889 --> 05:00.724
I'll take you to meet the chief.

05:05.145 --> 05:08.190
I didn't expect you to bring a stranger here.

05:09.222 --> 05:11.957
Alna, there's no red, is there?

05:12.402 --> 05:14.822
Yes, it's all blue.

05:15.030 --> 05:16.948
When I asked if he was an ally...

05:16.949 --> 05:19.368
he answered "yes"
with a very strong blue light.

05:20.285 --> 05:21.787
That's very interesting.

05:22.287 --> 05:24.414
Blue man, what is your name?

05:24.706 --> 05:26.900
Oh, I am Dias.

05:27.596 --> 05:28.544
Dias?

05:29.253 --> 05:31.853
I heard you are Alna's ally...

05:32.339 --> 05:34.925
so are you my ally, too?

05:35.342 --> 05:36.438
Of course.

05:36.635 --> 05:38.845
Everyone here is my people.

05:38.971 --> 05:42.724
The king has appointed me to be
the lord of this region.

05:44.885 --> 05:45.769
Alna.

05:46.478 --> 05:47.771
Don't be hasty.

05:48.175 --> 05:49.856
We are talking.

05:51.650 --> 05:54.228
Tell me the whole story...

05:54.908 --> 05:57.556
of how you were appointed as lord by the king.

05:58.438 --> 06:00.277
Right from the beginning?

06:03.448 --> 06:07.608
Whhen I began to develop my awareness,
I still had my parents.

06:08.141 --> 06:12.254
My mother always told me
to do things that are useful to others.

06:12.608 --> 06:16.868
My father wished that I become
a man who knows how to protect the weak.

06:17.261 --> 06:19.223
Those were also their dying wishes.

06:21.305 --> 06:25.677
When I just turned ten,
my parents died of a disease.

06:26.351 --> 06:29.980
I gathered children
who had also lost their parents like me...

06:30.314 --> 06:32.858
and we made money by cleaning the city...

06:33.150 --> 06:36.570
and hunting weak monsters for bounties.

06:37.154 --> 06:40.364
Generally, I always followed
my parents' dying wishes...

06:40.365 --> 06:43.118
and lived in a way
that would not bring shame to them.

06:44.077 --> 06:46.954
When I was 15, the war broke out.

06:46.955 --> 06:50.417
The enemy troops quickly
advanced to the neighboring town.

06:52.502 --> 06:55.964
To protect my comrades,
I volunteered to enlist.

06:56.965 --> 07:01.260
Even though I didn't realize it myself,
perhaps I had quite a talent for fighting.

07:01.261 --> 07:04.056
And I was frequently
mentioned in dispatches.

07:05.349 --> 07:08.602
Twenty years later, the war ended.

07:09.227 --> 07:12.230
The king rewarded me with a territory.

07:13.148 --> 07:19.404
Now I understand that you truly are a lord
who believes in being his people's defender.

07:21.156 --> 07:23.199
But I want to ask one thing.

07:23.200 --> 07:26.078
What if we are not
your people?

07:26.328 --> 07:28.538
Will you still be on our side?

07:28.914 --> 07:32.167
Well, we are neighbors
living on the same grassland.

07:32.584 --> 07:34.836
If you are in trouble, I will do my best.

07:35.337 --> 07:37.547
I think I can still be your ally.

07:41.510 --> 07:44.596
But why are you asking that?

07:45.138 --> 07:48.141
Those who live in the territory
are the lord's people...

07:49.234 --> 07:49.753
Huh?

07:50.519 --> 07:52.311
You've realized it, haven't you?

07:52.312 --> 07:54.982
We are not your people.

07:55.357 --> 07:56.475
Not only that...

07:56.858 --> 07:59.277
we are also the enemies of your king.

08:00.862 --> 08:05.993
We have fought against your nation
for many years.

08:07.911 --> 08:09.036
However...

08:09.037 --> 08:12.374
we might not be
the enemy of you necessarily.

08:14.710 --> 08:16.336
You possess the color blue.

08:16.670 --> 08:18.755
A rare kind of azure.

08:19.047 --> 08:22.718
If so, then we
should get along well.

08:23.301 --> 08:27.597
Now, raise your head and listen to me.

08:29.165 --> 08:30.574
My name is Mall.

08:31.143 --> 08:32.811
I am the chief of the demon tribe.

08:33.562 --> 08:38.274
For a very long time, we have always
been in conflict with your nation...

08:38.275 --> 08:41.028
to vie for
control of this grassland.

08:42.154 --> 08:45.531
Fifty years ago,
after losing a big war...

08:45.532 --> 08:48.577
the demon tribe had
to flee from this grassland.

08:49.786 --> 08:53.457
If you fled, why are
you all still able to live here now?

08:53.790 --> 08:56.585
By accumulating magical power
in this horn...

08:56.878 --> 08:59.087
we can use many types of spells.

08:59.921 --> 09:01.214
One of them is...

09:04.966 --> 09:06.384
Concealment.

09:07.179 --> 09:10.182
Thanks to this power,
the entire village is hidden...

09:10.682 --> 09:13.018
and we can even hide away our presence.

09:13.518 --> 09:16.813
No wonder
I couldn't find this place yesterday.

09:17.355 --> 09:21.443
But I am from the kingdom,
are you fine with telling me this?

09:21.818 --> 09:24.905
If you didn't possess the color blue,
I wouldn't have told you.

09:25.405 --> 09:28.408
There is a spell called Soul Appraisal.

09:29.326 --> 09:31.953
We'll know if there's an enemy
should there be red.

09:32.454 --> 09:34.790
Harmless and not an enemy,
it will be white.

09:35.457 --> 09:39.586
And blue is someone who will bring
happiness and blessings to us.

09:40.253 --> 09:44.465
If you lie even a little,
the color will cloud and gradually turn red.

09:44.466 --> 09:46.592
But you are not like that at all.

09:46.593 --> 09:48.303
Then I understand.

09:48.720 --> 09:52.348
To be honest, I've never
met anyone as honest and naive...

09:52.349 --> 09:56.728
as to live their whole life just to follow
their parents' dying wishes like you.

09:57.187 --> 09:59.356
Is this a compliment on me?

10:00.107 --> 10:02.775
I've been complimenting you this whole time.

10:02.776 --> 10:03.755
Also...

10:04.069 --> 10:08.323
I will also help you
in excelling as a lord.

10:09.741 --> 10:11.826
We cannot be your people...

10:11.827 --> 10:16.248
but we will share with you a temporary shelter,
food, and some livestock.

10:16.498 --> 10:20.751
In return, do not tell anyone
about this village.

10:20.752 --> 10:22.546
Of course, that includes your king.

10:22.838 --> 10:26.216
Personally, I don't have
any ill feelings toward you all.

10:26.508 --> 10:28.509
As long as there's no tension...

10:28.510 --> 10:31.096
it's fine if you all just live
on this grassland.

10:31.555 --> 10:35.809
For the time being,
I will let Alna stay by your side to help you.

10:36.226 --> 10:39.896
You two should live together
and learn how to survive here.

10:44.651 --> 10:48.154
Huh!?

10:48.155 --> 10:50.115
You are the one who brought him here.

10:50.493 --> 10:52.578
Take responsibility until the end.

10:53.211 --> 10:54.007
Understood?

10:57.998 --> 11:02.410
THE FRONTIER LORD AND THE BLUE HORN MAIDEN

11:04.415 --> 11:05.846
That's really fast.

11:06.923 --> 11:10.802
You just started putting it up and it's already almost done.

11:11.428 --> 11:15.055
When there's danger so great that even
concealment can't handle it...

11:15.056 --> 11:17.308
we dismantle
and take the whole house with us.

11:17.309 --> 11:18.810
It's why we make nomadic tents.

11:19.519 --> 11:22.063
This house is called a nomadic tent?

11:22.745 --> 11:23.648
Thank you.

11:28.987 --> 11:31.448
Later, food and Mear
will be brought here.

11:31.823 --> 11:34.283
Alna, what is a Mear?

11:34.284 --> 11:35.951
It's livestock.

11:35.952 --> 11:37.953
You should understand from the chat.

11:37.954 --> 11:39.623
Ah, right.

11:40.290 --> 11:44.753
If we just breed them to increase their numbers,
our income will also be more stable.

11:45.524 --> 11:49.215
When they bring them, I'll teach you
the best ways of looking after them.

11:49.216 --> 11:51.550
P-Please take care of me.

11:51.551 --> 11:55.137
Also, it would be nice if you could
also teach me how to grow the livestock.

11:55.138 --> 11:56.806
Who knows?

11:59.517 --> 12:01.143
Listen here...

12:01.144 --> 12:04.481
In the current situation,
what's the point of having more people?

12:04.773 --> 12:07.733
The tent and food are only enough
for you alone.

12:07.734 --> 12:10.445
More people will only lead
to mass starvation.

12:10.866 --> 12:11.746
That's true.

12:12.322 --> 12:13.448
Stupid lord.

12:14.032 --> 12:15.491
Here, take this.

12:15.492 --> 12:16.840
What is this?

12:17.202 --> 12:18.995
Catnip powder.

12:19.537 --> 12:22.785
Sprinkle it on the ground and
wild beasts will smell it and come.

12:23.041 --> 12:26.919
Hunt them and bring their meat and skin back to the village...

12:26.920 --> 12:29.798
and you can even trade
some of them for nomadic tents.

12:30.173 --> 12:33.217
Alright, I'm very good at hunting.

12:33.218 --> 12:36.346
It doesn't require much thinking anyway.

12:38.348 --> 12:40.809
This should be a good spot.

12:41.685 --> 12:43.728
I forgot to ask how much I should use.

12:44.104 --> 12:46.347
I'll just pour it all out.

12:48.790 --> 12:51.820
Now I just wait for the beasts to come?

12:52.112 --> 12:55.115
How many do I have to hunt
to exchange for one tent?

13:00.120 --> 13:01.329
How many are there?

13:01.538 --> 13:05.542
If I hunt all of them down,
I might be able to exchange for a few tents.

13:06.001 --> 13:06.918
Come!

13:09.754 --> 13:11.464
My fighting style is...

13:13.300 --> 13:17.095
to swing my axe instinctively
with all my might.

13:17.512 --> 13:18.972
That's all there is to it.

13:28.815 --> 13:32.944
I accidentally let half of them escape,
but this is enough for today.

13:35.191 --> 13:38.074
But how do I carry all of them back?

13:43.703 --> 13:46.249
I'll just take one with me back for now.

13:46.750 --> 13:50.295
I was so focused on hunting that
I didn't think about how to transport them.

13:51.171 --> 13:54.549
Alna is going to
look down on me again.

13:54.799 --> 13:58.845
Her icy glare
is truly terrifying.

14:06.558 --> 14:07.813
Not bad!

14:10.398 --> 14:14.569
Taking down a Black Bull on your first hunt
really shows you've got some skill.

14:16.624 --> 14:18.501
Is this called a Black Bull?

14:19.132 --> 14:22.618
Not just one,
I hunted about half the herd...

14:22.619 --> 14:24.287
but I can't bring them all back.

14:24.803 --> 14:26.538
Do you have a way to transport them?

14:26.539 --> 14:27.999
About how many is half?

14:28.666 --> 14:30.877
Between 30 and 40.

14:31.995 --> 14:33.921
That's a crazy amount!

14:33.922 --> 14:36.883
That's amazing,
I have to reassess you now.

14:37.717 --> 14:39.301
Not bad at all.

14:39.302 --> 14:41.654
You've already proved your manliness.

14:41.888 --> 14:46.058
Really, this is the first time I've seen
someone this manly.

14:46.059 --> 14:47.602
I'll go call the men here.

14:49.091 --> 14:51.022
We must hurry and bring the Black Bulls...

14:51.481 --> 14:55.026
that Dias hunted back
before it gets dark.

14:57.950 --> 14:59.375
She called my name.

15:00.281 --> 15:02.908
You're really strong.

15:02.909 --> 15:05.119
You really do have manliness.

15:05.120 --> 15:07.580
What is manliness?

15:08.164 --> 15:09.791
It's the worth of a man.

15:10.125 --> 15:13.169
Being hardworking
or bearing great responsibilities.

15:13.461 --> 15:16.339
All of that is a part of manliness.

15:17.757 --> 15:21.677
Does it have anything to do with
Alna suddenly cheering up?

15:21.678 --> 15:24.096
Alna is also a grown woman.

15:24.097 --> 15:26.265
Being in front of a capable man...

15:26.266 --> 15:28.767
it's only natural
that her mood would improve.

15:28.768 --> 15:32.063
So if you are capable,
will women like you?

15:32.397 --> 15:36.525
Of course there are other factors too,
like being handsome or good at talking.

15:36.526 --> 15:38.278
What are you talking about?

15:38.528 --> 15:41.698
Can being handsome and good at talking
fill your stomach?

15:42.282 --> 15:46.661
Marrying a man who isn't capable
will leave the wife and children to starvation.

15:47.120 --> 15:49.329
To women, besides manliness...

15:49.330 --> 15:52.000
everything else is worthless.

15:52.250 --> 15:54.919
The views here are quite different
from the kingdom.

15:55.920 --> 16:00.048
Because Alna is both beautiful and hardworking,
if you want to marry her...

16:00.049 --> 16:02.759
the bride price will have
to be more substantial.

16:02.760 --> 16:05.971
No, no, I didn't mean it like that at all.

16:05.972 --> 16:07.931
Don't worry.

16:07.932 --> 16:11.768
Whether you have horns or not,
you can still have children.

16:11.769 --> 16:15.398
No, that's not what I'm worried about!

16:27.535 --> 16:29.120
Good morning, Dias.

16:29.454 --> 16:31.456
Breakfast is ready.

16:34.834 --> 16:37.921
Oh, this is really delicious, Alna.

16:38.755 --> 16:40.589
Is that so?

16:40.590 --> 16:43.551
It wasn't too much trouble.

16:51.768 --> 16:53.026
By the way, Dias.

16:54.270 --> 16:55.825
What are you planning to hunt for today?

16:56.147 --> 16:58.200
Isn't yesterday's catch enough?

16:58.670 --> 17:02.271
If we want to gather people here,
we'll need a well and a toilet.

17:02.779 --> 17:06.199
It wouldn't be enough
If we ask the village craftsmen for them.

17:06.574 --> 17:09.117
So do I need to hunt Black Bulls again?

17:09.118 --> 17:13.873
No, if we only hunt one species,
the villagers will also face difficulties.

17:14.178 --> 17:16.681
Why don't you try hunting monsters today?

17:17.085 --> 17:18.544
Monsters?

17:18.879 --> 17:21.213
Their meat is full of miasma,
so it's inedible.

17:21.756 --> 17:25.885
But their claws, horns, and the magic stone
in their hearts can make for good profit.

17:26.694 --> 17:29.846
You've hunted monsters before,
haven't you?

17:29.847 --> 17:33.058
Yeah, but are there monsters around here?

17:33.059 --> 17:35.269
Not many, so you'll need
to look hard for them.

17:35.270 --> 17:38.272
I know a spell that can find monsters.

17:38.273 --> 17:41.483
If you go with me, it'll be done quickly.

17:41.484 --> 17:44.861
No, monsters are very dangerous.

17:44.862 --> 17:46.488
Just point me a way, and I'll...

17:46.489 --> 17:50.368
Hunting alone is boring.
It'll definitely be more fun with two people.

17:53.505 --> 17:54.580
I suppose so.

17:56.439 --> 17:59.793
The value of Mear isn't in their meat,
but in their fur...

17:59.794 --> 18:02.005
so brushing them is very important.

18:02.593 --> 18:04.173
Feels good, doesn't it, Francis?

18:06.760 --> 18:08.348
Next is your turn, François.

18:09.887 --> 18:11.129
Hey!

18:11.681 --> 18:12.557
Mr. Dias.

18:13.299 --> 18:15.622
We brought the dried meat
and blankets.

18:16.477 --> 18:17.478
Thank you.

18:17.687 --> 18:19.647
As for the nomadic tent, please wait a bit.

18:19.939 --> 18:21.899
The village craftsmen
haven't finish it yet.

18:22.283 --> 18:25.153
Please let them know there's no rush.

18:25.820 --> 18:29.570
It seems that if you are capable, even
the men will acknowledge you.

18:30.491 --> 18:31.534
Dias.

18:31.724 --> 18:33.726
I'm ready.

18:40.060 --> 18:41.919
Her makeup is completely different.

18:42.658 --> 18:43.627
How should I say this...

18:44.368 --> 18:45.153
She is very...

18:47.094 --> 18:47.717
I'm counting on you.

18:47.925 --> 18:48.801
Yeah.

18:49.927 --> 18:52.472
I've asked the men
to take care of the Mear.

18:53.139 --> 18:54.557
So today...

18:55.099 --> 18:58.353
I can be with you all the times.

19:04.067 --> 19:05.943
Yeah, let's go hunting quickly.

19:09.344 --> 19:11.115
Do they usually appear around here?

19:12.015 --> 19:14.743
Leave finding the monsters to me.

19:14.744 --> 19:18.497
I'm not only good at household chores
but also very skilled at magic.

19:18.498 --> 19:19.749
I'll leave it to you.

19:20.724 --> 19:21.040
Yeah.

19:24.379 --> 19:29.341
Yujinsis, Kuraspu, Intoshize, Intoriji.

19:29.342 --> 19:31.468
Intoare, Nyuinto.

19:31.469 --> 19:35.723
Shize, Fo, Intoje, Shize, Fau.

19:36.182 --> 19:40.228
Tore, Disuta, Sukurato, Ange, Atan.

19:42.746 --> 19:43.558
Found one.

19:44.115 --> 19:46.159
This monster is quite large.

19:47.568 --> 19:49.070
A large one?

19:49.404 --> 19:51.905
Let me go check out the situation first.

19:51.906 --> 19:52.906
You stay here...

19:52.907 --> 19:54.324
Have you forgotten?

19:54.325 --> 19:56.953
I can just conceal myself.

19:57.161 --> 20:01.374
If we encounter an opponent we can't beat,
we'll both hide and run away together.

20:03.153 --> 20:03.990
Understood.

20:04.544 --> 20:07.422
If you're not in danger,
then come along.

20:13.123 --> 20:13.980
That's...

20:14.738 --> 20:15.628
A turtle?

20:16.305 --> 20:19.474
It's an Earth Dragon.
What is it doing here?

20:19.475 --> 20:20.810
It's not a turtle?

20:21.060 --> 20:23.729
Alright, I'll just try hitting it once for now.

20:23.730 --> 20:26.691
Don't be crazy, it's a dragon!

20:27.900 --> 20:29.694
You just hide, Alna.

20:35.950 --> 20:37.577
It's really tough. In that case...

20:43.499 --> 20:45.752
It can even seal the hole?

20:46.043 --> 20:47.962
Take this chance to run away, Dias.

20:48.129 --> 20:51.757
Facing an Earth Dragon alone
is too reckless!

20:52.383 --> 20:55.636
I want to try my best
before thinking about running away.

20:58.681 --> 21:02.562
If one strike doesn't work,
then I'll strike two or three times.

21:03.102 --> 21:04.979
That's my fighting style.

21:21.579 --> 21:23.331
This is starting to look bad.

21:24.165 --> 21:24.874
Recover!

21:30.087 --> 21:31.088
Okay.

21:31.380 --> 21:33.633
A sight of it for the first time
will cause fear.

21:34.717 --> 21:37.512
This axe is the spoils of war
that I received...

21:37.810 --> 21:40.931
after defeating some general
from the neighboring country.

21:42.036 --> 21:45.795
It has a lion-like design,
and is unusually durable...

21:46.187 --> 21:48.835
while also capable
of regenerating slowly from small wear.

21:49.165 --> 21:52.827
If you focus your mind to force it to recover,
it will be fixed instantly.

21:53.861 --> 21:55.363
Now, let's continue.

22:09.710 --> 22:10.795
I give up.

22:11.254 --> 22:13.673
I hit it this much and the shell still hasn't broken?

22:16.342 --> 22:18.219
The Earth Dragon's miasma...

22:18.886 --> 22:21.806
Even standing this far away,
my body's still being corroded.

22:22.265 --> 22:23.558
Are you cold?

22:23.850 --> 22:26.394
It's probably time to go back.

22:26.727 --> 22:29.647
It's a pity we couldn't
take down this turtle...

22:30.940 --> 22:33.109
but we have to end it here!

22:35.611 --> 22:36.696
It broke!?

22:47.456 --> 22:49.208
It can launch an attack like that?

22:52.295 --> 22:53.296
Alna!

23:02.513 --> 23:04.265
Is it aiming at Alna?

23:05.600 --> 23:08.019
Attacking her instead of me?

23:08.477 --> 23:09.645
You cant'!

23:10.146 --> 23:11.731
I swore an oath.

23:12.148 --> 23:14.317
No matter who the enemy is...

23:14.692 --> 23:16.151
I will...

23:16.152 --> 23:17.320
protect...

23:17.987 --> 23:19.238
you!

23:25.703 --> 23:26.537
Alna!

23:32.084 --> 23:33.168
Alna?

23:33.169 --> 23:34.462
Marry me.

23:36.005 --> 23:38.716
I will marry you!

23:40.635 --> 23:45.056
Our hands tightly intertwined
along with our dreams

23:45.389 --> 23:49.476
The future we draw together

23:49.477 --> 23:53.481
Is always waiting there

24:01.405 --> 24:06.117
I don't know why
it's still that familiar path

24:06.118 --> 24:10.957
But there are days when my heart
suddenly feels heavy and wants to give up

24:11.207 --> 24:15.669
Tears fall, then a smile blooms

24:15.670 --> 24:20.967
Everyone in life has stepped through
days like that

24:21.467 --> 24:26.179
No matter what form
the dawn greets us in

24:26.180 --> 24:30.475
The promise made under the meteor shower

24:30.476 --> 24:33.228
Will never fade

24:33.229 --> 24:37.857
Nor can it be tarnished

24:37.858 --> 24:39.317
Please believe me

24:39.318 --> 24:44.072
Our hands tightly intertwined
along with our dreams

24:44.073 --> 24:48.827
Even if one day we accidentally lose each other

24:48.828 --> 24:53.456
We will definitely meet again under that sky

24:53.457 --> 24:59.296
It is a certainty

24:59.797 --> 25:04.260
So keep smiling
